# Dockerfile is checked in so `docker build .` works from a fresh clone. It is
# regenerable from Dockerfile.tmpl + sources.yaml via `make render`, and a CI
# job diffs the regenerated file to enforce that sources.yaml stays the single
# source of truth for versions.
